{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2d7be5147a35d0849dc24e30baba8d8dec2e8e2eeb5d51b465cc7ef89a859959", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\nそろそろ麗花の出番だけど、準備は終わったかな？）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真照杂志《I‧G‧R‧A！！》的日子。\n快轮到丽花上场了，不知道她准备好了没？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "99a3f1d7d37c8dce9b3a6a61d2a322ebc2e6aac63b4efb666842638564251d41", "ja": "キーンコーン、カーンコーン♪\n{$P$}さん、お待たせしました！", "zh": "当当当当──♪\n{$P$}先生，久等了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "35ae695a739ce62768ba49621fc5bad9ff20d0c114eaabe00c0a1e92799ca14b", "ja": "どうですか？　このスーツ。\n似合ってますか？", "zh": "怎么样？\n这身套装适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1003_p", "source_sha256": "46f8e9c7009c68fd821b4ae13756120e053904fd38d8b99d39871a4af677d99c", "ja": "うん、よく似合ってるよ。\nスーツなのに、学生っぽいのが不思議だけど。", "zh": "嗯，非常适合你喔。\n但神奇的是明明是套装，却有种学生气质呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "befec03c4c27742250a487e782d1cfc94791819ec1796ac650c7a569d18ac1b2", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪\n{$P$}さんも、似合ってますよ！", "zh": "谢谢称赞♪\n{$P$}先生穿起来也很适合喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1005_p", "source_sha256": "df941c3467e89472c14d8e4ae2cd4a318349d7ebf40bae4e19124092690250d7", "ja": "うん。いつものスーツだけど、ありがとう！", "zh": "嗯，虽然我每天都穿西装，但谢谢你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "24db7091bc86b986a3b9f3edb8bfc737c0169e474a24530dde6a188af1be59b0", "ja": "ふふっ、どういたしまして♪　高校生のみんなは\n学校の制服でしたけど、大学生はスーツなんですね。", "zh": "呵呵，不客气♪其他高中生都是穿学校制服，\n但大学生就是穿套装呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e4bc30039a8566b8b8adfbbe5588f682c435cbc6ec44e7f2c6d44df8ee941d81", "ja": "うん。……もしかして麗花も、\n高校生の制服の方が良かったとか？", "zh": "是啊。\n……丽花，你该不会也比较想穿高中制服吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "d899b5e41e646bde72f0e4f46023e93b89c13721e0098c15846ff6dd86970550", "ja": "高校の制服も、楽しいですよね！　着るだけで\n誰でも高校生になれちゃうし、素敵だと思いませんか？", "zh": "高中制服穿起来也很有意思呢！\n只要穿上，每个人都可以变成高中生，不觉得很棒吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "b6bab047ead7f33cf851a696b9b40a76c6b4d19f9947670ed5f240883a223a31", "ja": "それにとっても普通ですし、\nみんなとおそろいなのも楽しいですよね♪", "zh": "而且又很普遍，\n和大家穿一样的衣服也很有趣呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6a825995a3e6e17024b3e864f6b29b4e327636aa2976f18c1b2413da64e83708", "ja": "みんなとおそろいか……。\n制服って、そういうものなのかもな。", "zh": "大家都穿一样的衣服啊……\n也许制服就是这样的东西呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "6c19cd54d14eed91916e64b1d456f92f3e878ab5df90ffb861de1ef9edf3433c", "ja": "{$P$}さん。このスーツって、\n撮影が終わったらもらえるんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，拍摄结束之后，\n我可以把这套套装带走吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "42fc5211776f9f38260809d103b25f9588cc71804c3c0d75e6bdcd747565ab7b", "ja": "え？　いや、麗花専用ではあるけど、\n一応衣装だから……欲しいのか？", "zh": "咦？这套是丽花专用的没错啦，\n但再怎么说也是工作的服装……你想要吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "7534c768e4eab94015024cc1c52a52e210caaa664023f2a7550f1f6dd72545d7", "ja": "はい。とっても普通で、気に入っちゃいました♪\nでも、もらえないんですね～。残念……。", "zh": "是的，因为非常普通，我很喜欢♪\n原来不能带走啊～真可惜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "33ec919a86542c56be1bd2979a1a561c009666cb7124df43bc35a481f1600a61", "ja": "あっ！　じゃあじゃあ、こういうのはどうですか？\n私がトップアイドルになって、一日学長になるんです♪", "zh": "啊！那这样如何？\n我以后要成为顶尖偶像，去大学当一日校长♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "1ac6513710ef57191ee3fca02465fca594bac014861fab6e9ca72ae898839ecb", "ja": "そうしたら、学校に制服を導入しちゃいます！\n制服はもちろん、このスーツです。どうですか？", "zh": "然后我要把制服导入大学！\n制服当然就是这套套装，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1016_p", "source_sha256": "de4545e4c428cbdade504e373cebde9c7c55bf591694669252d4b563be485004", "ja": "ち、ちょっと待て……いや？\nうん、そうだな。一日学長、あるかもしれないな……。", "zh": "等、等等……你说什么？\n不过，也是呢，一日校长或许有可能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f68678446ac38a5f4723c3560e0285d30f52b43fc17befd90e6b34d26de5101a", "ja": "麗花が仕事を頑張ってトップアイドルになったら、\nいつかそんな仕事がくるかもな。", "zh": "如果丽花你努力工作、成了顶尖偶像，\n或许总有一天会接到这种工作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "440d7b5f99524b93a62c0d3d5926654a5a077a5adc7446c2b8432528a58fa6d1", "ja": "わーい♪　私、がんばりますね！　……あっ、\nそろそろ撮影が始まりますね！　行ってきまーす♪", "zh": "哇～♪我会加油的！\n……啊，差不多要开始拍摄了！我去工作啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3dfec9af849a2f05b14d1f8d9424e9879710bdf73b22b1ef92eac3d29ee97ffb", "ja": "（その後の麗花はご機嫌で、撮影は順調に終わった！\nそんなにスーツが気に入ったのか……）", "zh": "（之后丽花的心情非常好，顺利完成了摄影！\n她居然这么喜欢套装……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0103_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2c459b859c01afe81323c05991a92cd8b35413104cf7e3c9f53a9d3bcce46449", "ja": "（トップアイドルになって、一日学長か。\n……なるべく、早く叶えてやりたいな！）", "zh": "（成为顶尖偶像，当一日校长啊。\n……真希望能早日帮她实现这个心愿！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
